text It was a recording from TV.
text Depicted are high school students, dressed in various different uniforms.
text One of them is standing on a platform.
text Her posture is dignified, and she has long hair.
text I know just from her silhouette... It's Tomoyo.
text However, there's one thing that I'm not used to seeing.
text She's wearing glasses.
sound 87H.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Oh, yeah. She's been wearing those lately.
sound 87I.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Don't you think they look good on her?
text I don't answer, pretending I'm not actually watching. However, I continue to sit there, my eyes glued to the screen.
text Tomoyo takes the microphone in front of her and opens her mouth.
sound 87J.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text "─I bite the bullet in order to prevent the loneliness..."
sound 87K.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text "...If we hadn't known the row of cherry trees would have been gone, we wouldn't have found the fortune given by them..."
sound 87L.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text "...Because we all did nothing, except for making the grade by might and main..."
