text I found myself occasionally asking about Tomoyo.
text Although who I asked about wasn't Tomoyo as a person, but Tomoyo, as our school's student council president.
text And as I expected... Tomoyo had attained unwavering trust from the students.
text Starting from the day she separated herself from me...
text Tomoyo, who started to walk on without looking back...
text ...managed to appeal to many various people with her honesty and sincerity...
text From her class to all second-years, from all second-years to the entire school. Her circle of popularity had spread.
text And now that she's even turned into an eloquent public speaker on TV, her existence has become known all over the country.
text Within the school, she was now truly in the spotlight.
text And thus... every time I asked other people about her, I was overcome by a mysterious feeling.
