text That's right, right now "mysterious" is all I can call it.
text That I once spent time with a person like that.
text It was so ridiculous, it was laughable...
text And it was miraculous.
text What expressions did we make, what conversations did we have, for us to have been together?
text The student council president of a preparatory high school.
text Her scores on her tests had continually been at the top of her year.
text Someone everyone relies on...
text A celebrity whose activities are even reported on TV.
text For me, someone like that might as well be a foreigner I can't communicate with.
text With no common ground, there's no conversation we could have.
text Even our common sense is different.
text I really wonder how two such people were together.
text One month... It really is a long time.
text It truly was a mystery.
