text After today, Sunohara will be going back to his hometown.
text In order to go job-hunting.
text If he wouldn't go to university, he'd go back to his hometown and find a job... Apparently that's something he promised his parents.
text The day he said this to me, I remember it being a shock, as if reality was being thrust before me.
text That's right... The time to do stupid things is long past.
text Sunohara had always been far quicker in transitioning than me...
text He left me behind.
text That is true this time as well.
text I stay close under the kotatsu, trying to warm myself.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH15D"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
