text @[Sunohara]
text Well, I'll come back depending on how quick I get something, but...
sound 87W.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text At that point, we'll probably already be close to graduation.
sound 87X.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Although I guess you're probably going to be as busy with job-hunting as me, anyway...
sound 87Y.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text I'm sure the time will arrive in the blink of an eye.
