text @[Teacher]
text Actually, having been to a prestigious school can become a bottleneck.
text That's what the elderly teacher said.
sound 881.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Employers still prefer people who worked hard at a school of lower level over the leftovers from a pre-university school.
sound 882.aac
text @[Teacher]
text They'll make the decision just by looking at your academic record.
sound 883.aac
text @[Teacher]
text It's a question of how you are as a person, after all.
sound 884.aac
text @[Teacher]
text This is something you'd better be conscious about.
sound 885.aac
text @[Teacher]
text So that you aren't too shocked with the outcome.
sound 886.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Well, you still shouldn't give up.
sound 887.aac
text @[Teacher]
text You'll eventually find a job you can come to terms with.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Sunohara's probably experiencing the same difficulties...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (Well, it's him we're talking about...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (He probably understands his position in life better than me, at least...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (Right now, I'm far more childish than he is...)
