text When winter vacation came, I was truly alone.
text I spent my time in Sunohara's room, even though it was pretty meaningless.
text It was just a place I felt more comfortable in.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I've always been here, huh...)
text Three useless years that I've spent idly.
text Right now, I'm still at the same spot I was three years ago.
text Still, there's only one thing we can do right now...
text We're going to have to keep on running, like a bicycle with a broken brake.
text That's how I feel things will go.
text There's no way I'll be aiming to go up in life, and it'll probably take my all just maintaining what I have right now...
text Even so, if I don't go crazy, I will end up losing the lifestyle I'm having.
text I might just start running now, as if being chased by something.
text In this tiny town.
text I wonder if I'll be able to find something while I'm running.
text Although right now, I have no choice but to find SOMETHING.
text I get just a little scared.
text Will I really be able to find anything in my life from now on...?
text All the things that are truly important to me are buried in the past... And I probably won't want to dig those up ever again...
text Right now...
text Can't things just stay the same?
text I mean, living a life where I'll remember nothing but irritation...
text A life where I work my ass off every day...
text ...Really, I...
text ......
music ~
